  "source_title": "林巧稚\n她临终前最后一句话喊的是：\"快拿产钳来\"\n#林巧稚 #国之脊梁#科学家#历史人物#励志故事#名人故事#文字共鸣#情感共鸣#成长感悟#家国情怀",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 426.166667,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "他临终前最后一句话喊的是快拿产前来。一九八三年四月二十二号深夜，北京一间病房，一位八十二岁的老人躺在床上已经昏迷，忽然他嘴唇动了动，急促的喊了出来，快快拿产前来。产前护士吓了一跳，赶紧抓了样东西塞进他手里。老人握着那东西慢慢平息下来。过了一会儿，脸上竟然露出一丝微笑，说了最后一句话，又是一个胖娃娃，一晚上三个真好。然后他安静的走了。您说一个人临死前惦记的不是家人，不是财产，喊的，是一把接生用的钳子。他到底是谁？他叫林巧智，中国妇产科学的惦袭人，中国科学院第一位女院士。他一辈子没结过婚，没生过一个孩子，却亲手把五万多个新生命从死神手里拽了回来。孩子们管他叫万英之母，可就是这么一位神一样的人物。五岁那年，也曾跪在床边，眼睁睁看着母亲被病魔带走，哭的撕心裂肺却什么都做不了。一个五岁的孩子那时候能懂什么，可他懂了，一件事儿妈，没了，天塌了。从那天起，他心里种下一颗种子，我要当医生，我要让别人的妈不再死。一九二一年二十岁的他去考协和医学院，那学校有多难进百里挑一，能考进去的学生全是尖子，前几场考的顺风顺水。最后一门英语，他正埋头答题。考场里咕咚一声一个女同学中暑晕倒了。监考老师是个男的，看到是女生穿的裙子服也不是不服，也不是其他考生抬头瞟了一眼，赶紧低头，接着做题，生怕耽误一秒。只有林巧志把笔一扔，冲了过去，服人通风湿，毛巾擦脸。他守在旁边一步没挪，等他忙活完，英语考试早结束了。他心想，完了，这门成绩没了，录取这事儿肯定黄了。可一个月后，录取通知书直接寄到了家。后来他才知道，考官就认准了一句话，一个学生能在最要命的关头，放下自己的前程去救人。这就是当医生的料，分数可以补考，人品补不了。进了协和。他偏偏挑了又脏又累的妇产科。那时候医院有条不成文的规矩，女医生一旦结婚就得卷铺盖走人，意思明摆着要事业就别要加。林巧至没犹豫，直接把自己嫁给了医院，后来多少人给他介绍对象。银行家的儿子刘洋的博士条件一个比一个好，他全推了，别人急得跺脚，你真要一个人过一辈子，他低头写着病历，头也不抬的说，天天接受哪有空想这些。一九四一年，太平洋战争，爆发，协和医院被迫关门。有人劝他回鼓浪屿躲一躲，他摇头，我的病人还在这儿，我往哪儿躲。他在东塘子胡同租了几间房，开了间小诊所达官贵人来，他看拉洋车的来，他也看，碰上真穷的，他不但不收钱，还自掏腰包给产妇买鸡蛋，买红糖。兵荒马乱的年月，他心里只有一个念头，大人孩子能活下来，比什么都强。再后来那些年，他也受过委屈，被罚去打扫卫生，洗便盆，那双接生了几万个孩子的手，泡在冷水里，有人偷偷替他鸣不平。他只说了一句，只要还让我留在协和，干什么都行。您听这话，哪像一个受了委屈的人说的这就叫风骨。他给孕妇听胎心钱，一定先把冰凉的听诊器贴在自己手心里捂热。他说，母亲已经在受罪了，能少一点粮就少一点量。一九六二年，一个刚出生的婴儿，全身发黄，眼看不行了，这种病国内没人治过，家属都快放弃了。同事劝他，林大夫这病咱没治过，别接了，他摇头，只要有一线希望，我就得试试。他翻遍外文资料，一页，一夜找找到一种办法，脐带换血第一次没成功，第二次又复发。第三次孩子终于哭出了第一生，那是中国第一例被救回来的新生儿溶血症患儿。他救的不是一个孩子，他身后一整个家，晚年他瘫在病床上，手抖得握不住笔，就靠在在那儿口述，让学生记，硬是完成了五十万字的妇科肿瘤。他说我欠这个国家的还没还完。他临走前立下遗嘱三万元积蓄，全部捐给幼儿园托儿所遗体，居然给医学院做研究。骨灰洒回鼓浪屿的海面，您看他这一辈子，把自己整个人连最后一寸都交给了别人。所以当他弥留之际喊出快拿铲钱来的时候，您还觉得奇怪吗？那不是糊涂，那是他一生热爱的东西。在生命最后一刻又回来了。什么是真正的热爱？不是活着的时候说说而已，是到死的那一刻，还惦记着点亮红心收藏。这条视频转发出去，让更多人知道中国曾经有这样一位万英之母。关注我，明天告诉您，一个一辈子没结婚的女人，凭什么成了五万个孩子的妈？",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 4590,
      "text": "他临终前最后一句话喊的是快拿产前来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5670,
      "end_ms": 8230,
      "text": "一九八三年四月二十二号深夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00003",
      "start_ms": 8950,
      "end_ms": 10930,
      "text": "北京一间病房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00004",
      "start_ms": 11330,
      "end_ms": 15890,
      "text": "一位八十二岁的老人躺在床上已经昏迷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00005",
      "start_ms": 16309,
      "end_ms": 18530,
      "text": "忽然他嘴唇动了动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00006",
      "start_ms": 18890,
      "end_ms": 20210,
      "text": "急促的喊了出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00007",
      "start_ms": 20530,
      "end_ms": 22070,
      "text": "快快拿产前来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00008",
      "start_ms": 22430,
      "end_ms": 24810,
      "text": "产前护士吓了一跳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00009",
      "start_ms": 24990,
      "end_ms": 27810,
      "text": "赶紧抓了样东西塞进他手里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00010",
      "start_ms": 28590,
      "end_ms": 31860,
      "text": "老人握着那东西慢慢平息下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00011",
      "start_ms": 32720,
      "end_ms": 33660,
      "text": "过了一会儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00012",
      "start_ms": 33900,
      "end_ms": 36060,
      "text": "脸上竟然露出一丝微笑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00013",
      "start_ms": 36600,
      "end_ms": 37920,
      "text": "说了最后一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00014",
      "start_ms": 38520,
      "end_ms": 39880,
      "text": "又是一个胖娃娃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00015",
      "start_ms": 40360,
      "end_ms": 42400,
      "text": "一晚上三个真好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00016",
      "start_ms": 43100,
      "end_ms": 45280,
      "text": "然后他安静的走了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00017",
      "start_ms": 45740,
      "end_ms": 49940,
      "text": "您说一个人临死前惦记的不是家人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00018",
      "start_ms": 50180,
      "end_ms": 51140,
      "text": "不是财产，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00019",
      "start_ms": 51420,
      "end_ms": 51860,
      "text": "喊的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00020",
      "start_ms": 51860,
      "end_ms": 53700,
      "text": "是一把接生用的钳子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00021",
      "start_ms": 54160,
      "end_ms": 55080,
      "text": "他到底是谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00022",
      "start_ms": 56040,
      "end_ms": 57060,
      "text": "他叫林巧智，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00023",
      "start_ms": 58000,
      "end_ms": 60430,
      "text": "中国妇产科学的惦袭人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00024",
      "start_ms": 60530,
      "end_ms": 62615,
      "text": "中国科学院第一位女院士。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00025",
      "start_ms": 63410,
      "end_ms": 65025,
      "text": "他一辈子没结过婚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00026",
      "start_ms": 65420,
      "end_ms": 66775,
      "text": "没生过一个孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00027",
      "start_ms": 67150,
      "end_ms": 71985,
      "text": "却亲手把五万多个新生命从死神手里拽了回来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00028",
      "start_ms": 72990,
      "end_ms": 74855,
      "text": "孩子们管他叫万英之母，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00029",
      "start_ms": 75350,
      "end_ms": 77775,
      "text": "可就是这么一位神一样的人物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00030",
      "start_ms": 78120,
      "end_ms": 79095,
      "text": "五岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00031",
      "start_ms": 79450,
      "end_ms": 80985,
      "text": "也曾跪在床边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00032",
      "start_ms": 81520,
      "end_ms": 84445,
      "text": "眼睁睁看着母亲被病魔带走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00033",
      "start_ms": 84840,
      "end_ms": 87745,
      "text": "哭的撕心裂肺却什么都做不了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00034",
      "start_ms": 88410,
      "end_ms": 91195,
      "text": "一个五岁的孩子那时候能懂什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00035",
      "start_ms": 92160,
      "end_ms": 92960,
      "text": "可他懂了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00036",
      "start_ms": 92960,
      "end_ms": 94850,
      "text": "一件事儿妈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00037",
      "start_ms": 94870,
      "end_ms": 95330,
      "text": "没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00038",
      "start_ms": 95350,
      "end_ms": 96065,
      "text": "天塌了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00039",
      "start_ms": 96490,
      "end_ms": 97415,
      "text": "从那天起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00040",
      "start_ms": 97750,
      "end_ms": 99725,
      "text": "他心里种下一颗种子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00041",
      "start_ms": 100160,
      "end_ms": 101095,
      "text": "我要当医生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00042",
      "start_ms": 101460,
      "end_ms": 103655,
      "text": "我要让别人的妈不再死。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00043",
      "start_ms": 104580,
      "end_ms": 108385,
      "text": "一九二一年二十岁的他去考协和医学院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00044",
      "start_ms": 109040,
      "end_ms": 111735,
      "text": "那学校有多难进百里挑一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00045",
      "start_ms": 112090,
      "end_ms": 114125,
      "text": "能考进去的学生全是尖子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00046",
      "start_ms": 114550,
      "end_ms": 116395,
      "text": "前几场考的顺风顺水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00047",
      "start_ms": 117070,
      "end_ms": 118235,
      "text": "最后一门英语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00048",
      "start_ms": 118490,
      "end_ms": 119775,
      "text": "他正埋头答题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00049",
      "start_ms": 120220,
      "end_ms": 125255,
      "text": "考场里咕咚一声一个女同学中暑晕倒了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00050",
      "start_ms": 126330,
      "end_ms": 127875,
      "text": "监考老师是个男的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00051",
      "start_ms": 128550,
      "end_ms": 132040,
      "text": "看到是女生穿的裙子服也不是不服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00052",
      "start_ms": 132040,
      "end_ms": 135035,
      "text": "也不是其他考生抬头瞟了一眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00053",
      "start_ms": 135320,
      "end_ms": 136180,
      "text": "赶紧低头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00054",
      "start_ms": 136180,
      "end_ms": 136985,
      "text": "接着做题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00055",
      "start_ms": 137380,
      "end_ms": 138655,
      "text": "生怕耽误一秒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00056",
      "start_ms": 139270,
      "end_ms": 141485,
      "text": "只有林巧志把笔一扔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00057",
      "start_ms": 141850,
      "end_ms": 142615,
      "text": "冲了过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00058",
      "start_ms": 143180,
      "end_ms": 144940,
      "text": "服人通风湿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00059",
      "start_ms": 144940,
      "end_ms": 145945,
      "text": "毛巾擦脸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00060",
      "start_ms": 146230,
      "end_ms": 148275,
      "text": "他守在旁边一步没挪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00061",
      "start_ms": 148880,
      "end_ms": 149705,
      "text": "等他忙活完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00062",
      "start_ms": 150020,
      "end_ms": 151615,
      "text": "英语考试早结束了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00063",
      "start_ms": 151860,
      "end_ms": 152425,
      "text": "他心想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00064",
      "start_ms": 152810,
      "end_ms": 153385,
      "text": "完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00065",
      "start_ms": 153640,
      "end_ms": 154825,
      "text": "这门成绩没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00066",
      "start_ms": 155130,
      "end_ms": 156905,
      "text": "录取这事儿肯定黄了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00067",
      "start_ms": 157620,
      "end_ms": 158605,
      "text": "可一个月后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00068",
      "start_ms": 158960,
      "end_ms": 161555,
      "text": "录取通知书直接寄到了家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00069",
      "start_ms": 162090,
      "end_ms": 163065,
      "text": "后来他才知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00070",
      "start_ms": 163340,
      "end_ms": 164720,
      "text": "考官就认准了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00071",
      "start_ms": 164740,
      "end_ms": 167475,
      "text": "一个学生能在最要命的关头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00072",
      "start_ms": 167750,
      "end_ms": 169765,
      "text": "放下自己的前程去救人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00073",
      "start_ms": 170240,
      "end_ms": 171665,
      "text": "这就是当医生的料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00074",
      "start_ms": 172190,
      "end_ms": 173375,
      "text": "分数可以补考，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00075",
      "start_ms": 173740,
      "end_ms": 174705,
      "text": "人品补不了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00076",
      "start_ms": 175150,
      "end_ms": 176105,
      "text": "进了协和。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00077",
      "start_ms": 176430,
      "end_ms": 178925,
      "text": "他偏偏挑了又脏又累的妇产科。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00078",
      "start_ms": 179610,
      "end_ms": 181825,
      "text": "那时候医院有条不成文的规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00079",
      "start_ms": 182480,
      "end_ms": 185615,
      "text": "女医生一旦结婚就得卷铺盖走人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00080",
      "start_ms": 186190,
      "end_ms": 189195,
      "text": "意思明摆着要事业就别要加。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00081",
      "start_ms": 190220,
      "end_ms": 191645,
      "text": "林巧至没犹豫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00082",
      "start_ms": 191870,
      "end_ms": 193865,
      "text": "直接把自己嫁给了医院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00083",
      "start_ms": 194510,
      "end_ms": 196635,
      "text": "后来多少人给他介绍对象。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00084",
      "start_ms": 198010,
      "end_ms": 201930,
      "text": "银行家的儿子刘洋的博士条件一个比一个好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00085",
      "start_ms": 202050,
      "end_ms": 202845,
      "text": "他全推了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00086",
      "start_ms": 203150,
      "end_ms": 204145,
      "text": "别人急得跺脚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00087",
      "start_ms": 204600,
      "end_ms": 206375,
      "text": "你真要一个人过一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00088",
      "start_ms": 206730,
      "end_ms": 208055,
      "text": "他低头写着病历，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00089",
      "start_ms": 208470,
      "end_ms": 209515,
      "text": "头也不抬的说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00090",
      "start_ms": 209780,
      "end_ms": 212385,
      "text": "天天接受哪有空想这些。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00091",
      "start_ms": 213040,
      "end_ms": 213965,
      "text": "一九四一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00092",
      "start_ms": 214290,
      "end_ms": 215210,
      "text": "太平洋战争，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00093",
      "start_ms": 215210,
      "end_ms": 215715,
      "text": "爆发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00094",
      "start_ms": 216070,
      "end_ms": 217825,
      "text": "协和医院被迫关门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00095",
      "start_ms": 218450,
      "end_ms": 220845,
      "text": "有人劝他回鼓浪屿躲一躲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00096",
      "start_ms": 221560,
      "end_ms": 222205,
      "text": "他摇头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00097",
      "start_ms": 223580,
      "end_ms": 225015,
      "text": "我的病人还在这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00098",
      "start_ms": 225400,
      "end_ms": 226275,
      "text": "我往哪儿躲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00099",
      "start_ms": 227290,
      "end_ms": 230175,
      "text": "他在东塘子胡同租了几间房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00100",
      "start_ms": 230530,
      "end_ms": 233125,
      "text": "开了间小诊所达官贵人来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00101",
      "start_ms": 234330,
      "end_ms": 235890,
      "text": "他看拉洋车的来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00102",
      "start_ms": 236110,
      "end_ms": 236795,
      "text": "他也看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00103",
      "start_ms": 237760,
      "end_ms": 239095,
      "text": "碰上真穷的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00104",
      "start_ms": 239330,
      "end_ms": 240585,
      "text": "他不但不收钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00105",
      "start_ms": 241000,
      "end_ms": 243915,
      "text": "还自掏腰包给产妇买鸡蛋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00106",
      "start_ms": 244210,
      "end_ms": 244905,
      "text": "买红糖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00107",
      "start_ms": 245410,
      "end_ms": 246935,
      "text": "兵荒马乱的年月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00108",
      "start_ms": 247170,
      "end_ms": 248675,
      "text": "他心里只有一个念头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00109",
      "start_ms": 249240,
      "end_ms": 250585,
      "text": "大人孩子能活下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00110",
      "start_ms": 250970,
      "end_ms": 251795,
      "text": "比什么都强。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00111",
      "start_ms": 252880,
      "end_ms": 253915,
      "text": "再后来那些年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00112",
      "start_ms": 254260,
      "end_ms": 255535,
      "text": "他也受过委屈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00113",
      "start_ms": 256260,
      "end_ms": 257725,
      "text": "被罚去打扫卫生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00114",
      "start_ms": 258070,
      "end_ms": 258765,
      "text": "洗便盆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00115",
      "start_ms": 259610,
      "end_ms": 262005,
      "text": "那双接生了几万个孩子的手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00116",
      "start_ms": 262620,
      "end_ms": 263835,
      "text": "泡在冷水里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00117",
      "start_ms": 264220,
      "end_ms": 266155,
      "text": "有人偷偷替他鸣不平。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00118",
      "start_ms": 266900,
      "end_ms": 267995,
      "text": "他只说了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00119",
      "start_ms": 268510,
      "end_ms": 270495,
      "text": "只要还让我留在协和，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00120",
      "start_ms": 270920,
      "end_ms": 271985,
      "text": "干什么都行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00121",
      "start_ms": 272220,
      "end_ms": 273045,
      "text": "您听这话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00122",
      "start_ms": 273460,
      "end_ms": 277935,
      "text": "哪像一个受了委屈的人说的这就叫风骨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00123",
      "start_ms": 278640,
      "end_ms": 280545,
      "text": "他给孕妇听胎心钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00124",
      "start_ms": 280990,
      "end_ms": 285465,
      "text": "一定先把冰凉的听诊器贴在自己手心里捂热。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00125",
      "start_ms": 286100,
      "end_ms": 286555,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00126",
      "start_ms": 286860,
      "end_ms": 288365,
      "text": "母亲已经在受罪了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00127",
      "start_ms": 288760,
      "end_ms": 291085,
      "text": "能少一点粮就少一点量。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00128",
      "start_ms": 292070,
      "end_ms": 293070,
      "text": "一九六二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00129",
      "start_ms": 293990,
      "end_ms": 295830,
      "text": "一个刚出生的婴儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00130",
      "start_ms": 296530,
      "end_ms": 297630,
      "text": "全身发黄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00131",
      "start_ms": 298370,
      "end_ms": 299670,
      "text": "眼看不行了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00132",
      "start_ms": 300550,
      "end_ms": 304210,
      "text": "这种病国内没人治过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00133",
      "start_ms": 304610,
      "end_ms": 306310,
      "text": "家属都快放弃了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00134",
      "start_ms": 307170,
      "end_ms": 308330,
      "text": "同事劝他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00135",
      "start_ms": 309530,
      "end_ms": 312650,
      "text": "林大夫这病咱没治过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00136",
      "start_ms": 313510,
      "end_ms": 314330,
      "text": "别接了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00137",
      "start_ms": 315470,
      "end_ms": 316130,
      "text": "他摇头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00138",
      "start_ms": 316330,
      "end_ms": 317490,
      "text": "只要有一线希望，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00139",
      "start_ms": 317590,
      "end_ms": 318450,
      "text": "我就得试试。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00140",
      "start_ms": 319350,
      "end_ms": 320910,
      "text": "他翻遍外文资料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00141",
      "start_ms": 321150,
      "end_ms": 321570,
      "text": "一页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00142",
      "start_ms": 321570,
      "end_ms": 324340,
      "text": "一夜找找到一种办法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00143",
      "start_ms": 325040,
      "end_ms": 329200,
      "text": "脐带换血第一次没成功，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00144",
      "start_ms": 330020,
      "end_ms": 333400,
      "text": "第二次又复发。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00145",
      "start_ms": 333760,
      "end_ms": 336820,
      "text": "第三次孩子终于哭出了第一生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00146",
      "start_ms": 337360,
      "end_ms": 341780,
      "text": "那是中国第一例被救回来的新生儿溶血症患儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00147",
      "start_ms": 342200,
      "end_ms": 344660,
      "text": "他救的不是一个孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00148",
      "start_ms": 344940,
      "end_ms": 346400,
      "text": "他身后一整个家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00149",
      "start_ms": 346820,
      "end_ms": 348900,
      "text": "晚年他瘫在病床上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00150",
      "start_ms": 349280,
      "end_ms": 350820,
      "text": "手抖得握不住笔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00151",
      "start_ms": 351200,
      "end_ms": 352575,
      "text": "就靠在在那儿口述，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00152",
      "start_ms": 353070,
      "end_ms": 353915,
      "text": "让学生记，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00153",
      "start_ms": 354250,
      "end_ms": 357065,
      "text": "硬是完成了五十万字的妇科肿瘤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00154",
      "start_ms": 357270,
      "end_ms": 360535,
      "text": "他说我欠这个国家的还没还完。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00155",
      "start_ms": 361050,
      "end_ms": 364335,
      "text": "他临走前立下遗嘱三万元积蓄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00156",
      "start_ms": 364630,
      "end_ms": 367910,
      "text": "全部捐给幼儿园托儿所遗体，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00157",
      "start_ms": 368130,
      "end_ms": 369795,
      "text": "居然给医学院做研究。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00158",
      "start_ms": 370470,
      "end_ms": 372895,
      "text": "骨灰洒回鼓浪屿的海面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00159",
      "start_ms": 373220,
      "end_ms": 375015,
      "text": "您看他这一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00160",
      "start_ms": 375390,
      "end_ms": 380165,
      "text": "把自己整个人连最后一寸都交给了别人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00161",
      "start_ms": 381050,
      "end_ms": 385455,
      "text": "所以当他弥留之际喊出快拿铲钱来的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00162",
      "start_ms": 385960,
      "end_ms": 387295,
      "text": "您还觉得奇怪吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00163",
      "start_ms": 387920,
      "end_ms": 388835,
      "text": "那不是糊涂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00164",
      "start_ms": 389300,
      "end_ms": 391065,
      "text": "那是他一生热爱的东西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00165",
      "start_ms": 391550,
      "end_ms": 393755,
      "text": "在生命最后一刻又回来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00166",
      "start_ms": 395240,
      "end_ms": 396885,
      "text": "什么是真正的热爱？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00167",
      "start_ms": 397830,
      "end_ms": 399825,
      "text": "不是活着的时候说说而已，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00168",
      "start_ms": 400570,
      "end_ms": 402135,
      "text": "是到死的那一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00169",
      "start_ms": 402720,
      "end_ms": 407180,
      "text": "还惦记着点亮红心收藏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00170",
      "start_ms": 407260,
      "end_ms": 410985,
      "text": "这条视频转发出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00171",
      "start_ms": 411480,
      "end_ms": 417880,
      "text": "让更多人知道中国曾经有这样一位万英之母。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00172",
      "start_ms": 418720,
      "end_ms": 419380,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00173",
      "start_ms": 419580,
      "end_ms": 420560,
      "text": "明天告诉您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00174",
      "start_ms": 420840,
      "end_ms": 423140,
      "text": "一个一辈子没结婚的女人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b6edef1a6d54291a_s00175",
      "start_ms": 423380,
      "end_ms": 426055,
      "text": "凭什么成了五万个孩子的妈？"
    }
  ],
